            <text:p>名稱　　　　統一編號　　　　代表人或管理人姓名</text:p>
          </table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellSmall" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p>關係人與公職人員間係第 3 條第 1 項各款之關係</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellSmall"><text:p>□第 1 款</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellSmall" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p>公職人員之配偶或共同生活之家屬</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellSmall"><text:p>□第 2 款</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellSmall" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>公職人員之二親等以內親屬</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellSmall"><text:p>稱謂：</text:p></table:table-cell>
